---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import me from '../assets/photos/me.jpg';
import highschool from '../assets/photos/highschool.jpg';
import sfscene from '../assets/photos/sfscene.jpg';
import ambulance from '../assets/photos/ambulance.jpg';
import naturescene from '../assets/photos/naturescene.jpg';
import traders from '../assets/photos/traders.jpg';
import saas from '../assets/photos/saas.jpg';

const wideSizes = '(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 680px';
const tallSizes = '(max-width: 420px) 88vw, 360px';
---
<Base title="About">
  <Hero page="about" compact />

  <section class="about">
    <Image class="about-lead" src={me} alt="Alexander Xu" widths={[200, 400]} sizes="200px" loading="eager" />

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>
        I grew up in New York. During COVID I taught myself Java out of boredom
        and became hooked on competitive programming. This was my first real
        passion for anything academic (I only liked playing video games haha).
        Each day I explored something new and built hobby projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="photo photo-tall">
      <Image src={highschool} alt="High school years in New York" widths={[360, 720]} sizes={tallSizes} />
    </figure>

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>
        In September 2024 I moved to California to study CS at UC Berkeley.
        Freshman spring I took computer architecture with Professor Lisa Yan,
        and it blew my mind, literally rewired how I think about software. Since
        then my interests have shifted toward systems and hardware. Sophomore
        year I took operating systems, compilers, database systems, graduate
        computer architecture, digital circuit design (ASICs), and internet
        architecture.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="photo photo-wide">
      <Image src={sfscene} alt="San Francisco Bay Area" widths={[680, 1360]} sizes={wideSizes} />
    </figure>

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>
        Now I'm graduating two years early to keep exploring. Please reach out
        if you have internship or full-time opportunities starting Fall 2026!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>
        Before college, I spent two years as a volunteer emergency medical
        technician and led my Boy Scout troop as Senior Patrol Leader.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="photo photo-wide">
      <Image src={ambulance} alt="Volunteering as an EMT" widths={[680, 1360]} sizes={wideSizes} />
    </figure>

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>These days I still enjoy camping and exploring national parks with my family.</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="photo photo-wide">
      <Image src={naturescene} alt="A national park" widths={[680, 1360]} sizes={wideSizes} />
    </figure>

    <div class="bio-part">
      <p>
        In college, I have also been heavily involved with two clubs, Traders at
        Berkeley and SAAS, which have been a huge part of my experience here.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="photo-pair">
      <figure class="photo photo-wide">
        <Image src={saas} alt="Student Association for Applied Statistics" widths={[480, 960]} sizes={wideSizes} />
      </figure>
      <figure class="photo photo-tall">
        <Image src={traders} alt="Traders at Berkeley" widths={[300, 600]} sizes={tallSizes} />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
